data: {"type":"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT","messageId":"3d61f68f0e184dab811d9d50544a392d","delta":"I can't answer this for Guayaquil, because it isn't a place I can query. Only provinces, cantons and protected areas of the Ecuador module can be named, and a search for Guayaquil returned no match. That includes a search limited to cantons. The module covers the Ecuadorian Amazon, and Guayaquil is on the coast.\n\nYou have two options:\n- **Send a GeoJSON polygon.** I can then look up the Ecosystems layer (Ecosystem Map of Continental Ecuador, characterised for 2012, 51 classes in the module) for that area. If the polygon lies outside the module, the layer will probably return nothing.\n- **Name another place.** Pick a province, canton or protected area in the Ecuadorian Amazon, such as Pastaza, Tena or Yasuní. I can list the ecosystems there."}

data: {"type":"TEXT_MESSAGE_END","messageId":"3d61f68f0e184dab811d9d50544a392d"}

